      hu: ["Kleop\\u00e1tra n\\u00e9ven is ismert volt.", "Er\\u0151s er\\u0151d\\u00edtm\\u00e9nyekkel rendelkezett.", "Sok ker\\u00e1mi\\u00e1t tal\\u00e1ltak itt."],
      ro: ["Cunoscut \\u0219i sub numele de Cleopatra.", "Fortifica\\u021bii puternice.", "Mult\\u0103 ceramic\\u0103 g\\u0103sit\\u0103 aici."],
