      hu: "Hatalmas er\\u0151d\\u00edtm\\u00e9ny Tripoliban, gazdag oszm\\u00e1n \\u00e9s spanyol t\\u00f6rt\\u00e9nelemmel.",
      ro: "O fort\\u0103rea\\u021b\\u0103 masiv\\u0103 \\u00een Tripoli cu o istorie bogat\\u0103 din perioadele otoman\\u0103 \\u0219i spaniol\\u0103.",
      en: "A massive fortress in Tripoli with a rich history spanning Ottoman and Spanish periods."
